# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says: Biome formats with LF, and tests compare files as
# written (generated CSS, golden files). A Windows checkout with autocrlf=true would otherwise get
# CRLF and fail `pnpm lint` on every file.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary

packages/protocol/CHANGES.md merge=union
